      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im starting taking atorvastatin for my cholesterol because my doc said it's getting a bit high. i also love having grapefruit juice every morning for the vitamin c and to help with my digestion. is there any reason i shouldn't do both?",
      "source": "evaluator"
